WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:00.983
- You need to know two things

00:00:00.983 --> 00:00:03.790
about me going into this
story, I bear a lot of grudges

00:00:03.790 --> 00:00:05.512
and I love French cuisine.

00:00:05.512 --> 00:00:07.762
(laughter)

00:00:09.454 --> 00:00:10.287
I love French cuisine

00:00:10.287 --> 00:00:13.483
and that's why this story
takes place in a Pret A Manger.

00:00:13.483 --> 00:00:15.053
(laughter)

00:00:15.053 --> 00:00:16.633
Ah, have you been there? Mamma mia!

00:00:16.633 --> 00:00:18.222
(laughter)

00:00:18.222 --> 00:00:20.140
Ah. I love manger in there,

00:00:20.140 --> 00:00:22.782
there's so much much good stuff to manger.

00:00:22.782 --> 00:00:25.043
I love to manger in Pret A Manger.

00:00:25.043 --> 00:00:27.070
I think my favorite thing to manger there

00:00:27.070 --> 00:00:29.780
is the yogurts . I love
to manger the yogurts.

00:00:29.780 --> 00:00:32.260
They're in a pot and it's granola on top,

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:34.510
then mainly yogurt, then
fruit compote at the bottom.

00:00:34.510 --> 00:00:36.888
You know, the way they eat it in Paris.

00:00:36.888 --> 00:00:37.721
(laughter)

00:00:37.721 --> 00:00:39.670
And you get a spoon and
you mix it all together

00:00:39.670 --> 00:00:41.590
and you then you manger
it that way, if you like.

00:00:41.590 --> 00:00:42.740
I don't actually mix it.

00:00:42.740 --> 00:00:45.140
I just leave it as it is, and
I work my way down in order.

00:00:45.140 --> 00:00:46.530
I start off with nothing but granola,

00:00:46.530 --> 00:00:48.220
just shoving raw granola into my mouth,

00:00:48.220 --> 00:00:50.150
deflecting off my teeth this way and that.

00:00:50.150 --> 00:00:52.530
And then I power through the
yogurt for a really long time,

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:54.340
getting precious little
out of it if I'm honest.

00:00:54.340 --> 00:00:56.036
It's a real trudge. You know what I mean?

00:00:56.036 --> 00:00:57.578
I don't like the yogurt part.

00:00:57.578 --> 00:00:58.990
And then I end on the tangy compote,

00:00:58.990 --> 00:01:00.493
like, "Whoa, what a finale. Oh, my God!

00:01:00.493 --> 00:01:02.660
"All the favor at once. Ah."

00:01:02.660 --> 00:01:03.930
That's how I eat yogurt, son.

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:05.340
I eat them like they're packaged.

00:01:05.340 --> 00:01:06.460
That's why I like them Fruit Corners.

00:01:06.460 --> 00:01:08.339
They come with that little chaser.

00:01:08.339 --> 00:01:10.589
(laughter)

00:01:19.760 --> 00:01:21.170
I went in Pret A Manger one day,

00:01:21.170 --> 00:01:24.020
all I wanted was a banana.
That's all I wanted to manger.

00:01:24.880 --> 00:01:26.457
Doesn't ever get less funny, that.

00:01:26.457 --> 00:01:27.900
(laughter)

00:01:27.900 --> 00:01:29.849
Every time I say it, it's still funny.

00:01:29.849 --> 00:01:32.220
(scattered laughter)

00:01:32.220 --> 00:01:33.660
Got a banana, put it on the counter,

00:01:33.660 --> 00:01:36.350
I said, "Just that, s'il vous plait."

00:01:36.350 --> 00:01:37.183
(laughter)

00:01:37.183 --> 00:01:38.034
Make the effort.

00:01:38.034 --> 00:01:38.877
Make the effort in Pret
A Manger, actually.

00:01:38.877 --> 00:01:40.233
I make the effort, you should.

00:01:41.397 --> 00:01:42.760
"Just that, s'il vous plait."

00:01:42.760 --> 00:01:44.130
The lady behind the counter,

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:48.427
she goes, "Oh. Oh, we're giving
away free bananas today."

00:01:50.457 --> 00:01:52.300
"Thanks very much."

00:01:52.300 --> 00:01:54.260
Picked up the banana, I turned to leave,

00:01:54.260 --> 00:01:58.947
she goes, "Hold on a
second, where are you going?

00:01:58.947 --> 00:02:00.977
"I said we're giving away free bananas.

00:02:00.977 --> 00:02:04.917
"I didn't say all of
the bananas are free."

00:02:07.708 --> 00:02:08.980
(scattered laughter)

00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:10.620
How unnecessary. I don't
know what I've done

00:02:10.620 --> 00:02:11.810
to offend this woman in the past,

00:02:11.810 --> 00:02:13.500
but she's laid a language loophole for me,

00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:16.060
and I've fallen for it
hook, line and sinker.

00:02:16.060 --> 00:02:17.210
I wasn't going to rise to it, though.

00:02:17.210 --> 00:02:20.083
Stayed very calm. I said, "Oh, I'm sorry.

00:02:21.077 --> 00:02:22.958
"Which of the bananas...

00:02:22.958 --> 00:02:25.457
(laughter)

00:02:25.457 --> 00:02:27.060
"are free?"

00:02:27.060 --> 00:02:28.620
A soon as I asked that,
I think it highlighted

00:02:28.620 --> 00:02:30.030
how insane it would have
been if that had been

00:02:30.030 --> 00:02:32.483
my initial response.
If someone says to you,

00:02:32.483 --> 00:02:34.577
(laughter)

00:02:34.577 --> 00:02:36.380
"We're giving away free bananas today,"

00:02:36.380 --> 00:02:37.717
and without question you go,

00:02:37.717 --> 00:02:39.342
"Which specific ones?

00:02:39.342 --> 00:02:40.887
(laughter)

00:02:40.887 --> 00:02:42.523
"Looking at this box of bananas,

00:02:42.523 --> 00:02:43.457
"I want to know which individual ones

00:02:43.457 --> 00:02:44.837
"the offer applies to.

00:02:44.837 --> 00:02:45.670
"It can't be all of them.

00:02:45.670 --> 00:02:48.157
"We're not living in a fantasy land.

00:02:48.157 --> 00:02:49.847
"This isn't my dreams."

00:02:53.187 --> 00:02:54.380
"Which bananas are free?"

00:02:54.380 --> 00:02:55.860
Her eyes lit up. She
couldn't wait to tell me

00:02:55.860 --> 00:02:56.860
which bananas were free.

00:02:56.860 --> 00:02:57.770
She goes, "These ones."

00:02:57.770 --> 00:03:00.770
And she pointed at this
pile of jet black bananas,

00:03:00.770 --> 00:03:03.130
just black as the night sky.

00:03:03.130 --> 00:03:05.510
Just wobbling as well, there
was no solids in those skins,

00:03:05.510 --> 00:03:06.790
just a pile on the counter,

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:09.279
and I didn't want to
manger no dead banana.

00:03:09.279 --> 00:03:10.442
(laughter)

00:03:10.442 --> 00:03:11.900
Look, I know you can't
tell what a banana's like

00:03:11.900 --> 00:03:13.230
on the outside based on the inside.

00:03:13.230 --> 00:03:14.410
I know that. I'm an adult.

00:03:14.410 --> 00:03:16.370
But some bananas, ugly on the outside,

00:03:16.370 --> 00:03:17.750
beautiful on the inside.

00:03:17.750 --> 00:03:19.460
Other bananas, beautiful on the outside,

00:03:19.460 --> 00:03:20.520
ugly on the inside.

00:03:20.520 --> 00:03:22.640
It's evolution's way of
making sure shallow people

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:25.040
don't get enough
potassium in their bodies.

00:03:25.040 --> 00:03:25.873
And rightfully so.

00:03:25.873 --> 00:03:27.120
Deserve everything they
get, shallow people.

00:03:27.120 --> 00:03:29.367
If there's any shallow
people in tonight, get out.

00:03:29.367 --> 00:03:30.520
(laughter)

00:03:30.520 --> 00:03:31.770
None of them are welcome.

00:03:33.330 --> 00:03:35.810
Be that as at may, I turned down the offer

00:03:35.810 --> 00:03:38.340
and I paid full price
for my yellow banana.

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:39.930
As I'm handing her the money,

00:03:39.930 --> 00:03:41.070
she does this face at me.

00:03:41.070 --> 00:03:42.350
Clearly what she wanted to do

00:03:42.350 --> 00:03:43.810
was look at someone and roll her eyes

00:03:43.810 --> 00:03:45.730
at the guy paying full
price for the banana.

00:03:45.730 --> 00:03:46.670
But no one else was around,

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:48.047
so she kind of looked at me and went,

00:03:48.047 --> 00:03:49.227
"Oh, no. That's the guy."

00:03:49.227 --> 00:03:51.477
(laughter)

00:03:58.130 --> 00:04:00.170
I'm almost at the door, nearly home free,

00:04:00.170 --> 00:04:03.160
hand on the handle, and I
hear her mutter to herself.

00:04:03.160 --> 00:04:05.838
And this still boils my
blood to this day, actually.

00:04:05.838 --> 00:04:07.188
Under her breath, she goes,

00:04:10.857 --> 00:04:13.257
"He thinks he's too
good for a free banana."

00:04:14.158 --> 00:04:17.241
(scattered laughter)

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:21.930
Never before have I been so offended

00:04:23.321 --> 00:04:26.274
by something I 100% agree with.

00:04:26.274 --> 00:04:28.254
(laughter)

00:04:28.254 --> 00:04:29.550
Yeah, I am too god for
a free banana, actually.

00:04:29.550 --> 00:04:30.600
We all are, aren't we?

00:04:30.600 --> 00:04:31.497
If you're sitting there thinking,

00:04:31.497 --> 00:04:32.330
"Oh, I'm not,"

00:04:32.330 --> 00:04:34.217
believe in yourself a little bit.

00:04:34.217 --> 00:04:37.277
It is a banana. It is a banana.

00:04:37.277 --> 00:04:38.410
You've never been standing
there holding a banana

00:04:38.410 --> 00:04:39.437
and someone's come up to you and gone,

00:04:39.437 --> 00:04:41.420
"Ooh, you're punching above
your weight, aren't you?"

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:42.253
It's never happened.

00:04:42.253 --> 00:04:43.086
(laughter)

00:04:43.086 --> 00:04:45.443
It's lucky to have you
if anything, that banana.

00:04:47.810 --> 00:04:48.900
Couldn't get it out of my head.

00:04:48.900 --> 00:04:50.370
Days, weeks, months went by.

00:04:50.370 --> 00:04:52.350
I was still furious about it.

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:54.400
Went past Pret A Manger nine months later,

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:56.370
looked in the window, the
bananas were gone at this point.

00:04:56.370 --> 00:04:58.350
Frankly, I was surprised.

00:04:58.350 --> 00:04:59.730
I half expected them to have been

00:04:59.730 --> 00:05:01.590
decanted into a paddling pool with a sign

00:05:01.590 --> 00:05:04.260
stuck in them that said, "Free smoothies,"

00:05:04.260 --> 00:05:06.367
so people could drag their cups
through the mush and leave.

00:05:06.367 --> 00:05:08.070
"Oh, Pret A Manger, your generosity

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:09.604
continues to astound us."

00:05:09.604 --> 00:05:11.854
(laughter)

00:05:12.940 --> 00:05:15.812
The bananas were gone,
but my nemesis was not.

00:05:15.812 --> 00:05:18.150
(laughter)

00:05:18.150 --> 00:05:19.260
She was standing behind the counter,

00:05:19.260 --> 00:05:21.605
handing someone a Danish like prick.

00:05:21.605 --> 00:05:22.720
(laughter)

00:05:22.720 --> 00:05:23.653
Like a prick.

00:05:24.488 --> 00:05:27.213
(scattered laughter)

00:05:27.213 --> 00:05:28.092
Was furious, still angry.

00:05:28.092 --> 00:05:29.090
I knew I had to get revenge.

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:30.980
And I know exactly how I'm
going to do it now as well.

00:05:30.980 --> 00:05:31.920
Got it all planned out.

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:35.050
Step one, I'm going to
open my own banana shop

00:05:36.140 --> 00:05:38.330
in her neck of the woods.

00:05:38.330 --> 00:05:39.960
And that's alls we sell, is bananas.

00:05:39.960 --> 00:05:41.830
Well, sooner or later,
she's going to go in.

00:05:41.830 --> 00:05:43.920
Because let's face it, if a shop opens up

00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:46.040
in your neck of the woods
that only sell bananas

00:05:46.040 --> 00:05:46.873
and nothing else,

00:05:46.873 --> 00:05:49.707
you're going to go in at
some point just to see.

00:05:49.707 --> 00:05:51.759
"Does it really just sell bananas?"

00:05:51.759 --> 00:05:53.430
(laughter)

00:05:53.430 --> 00:05:55.930
Once you're in the shop
that only sells bananas,

00:05:55.930 --> 00:05:57.890
you've got to buy a banana.

00:05:57.890 --> 00:05:59.670
Because only a maniac would go in the shop

00:05:59.670 --> 00:06:00.807
that only sells bananas and go,

00:06:00.807 --> 00:06:02.500
"I'm sorry, you haven't
got what I'm looking for,"

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:03.584
and then leave.

00:06:03.584 --> 00:06:06.200
(laughter)

00:06:06.200 --> 00:06:07.900
I've got her where I want her now.

00:06:09.945 --> 00:06:11.790
She'll come in, pick up a
banana, put it on the counter,

00:06:11.790 --> 00:06:13.480
she'll go, "Just that, please."

00:06:13.480 --> 00:06:18.437
And I'll go, "Oh. Oh,
hey, we're giving away

00:06:18.437 --> 00:06:20.077
"free bananas today."

00:06:21.358 --> 00:06:24.120
(scattered laughter)

00:06:24.120 --> 00:06:26.880
And she'll go, "Oh which ones are free?"

00:06:26.880 --> 00:06:27.713
Because let's face it,

00:06:27.713 --> 00:06:29.830
I'm not going to trip her
up at this hurdle, am I?

00:06:29.830 --> 00:06:31.346
She invented this trick.

00:06:31.346 --> 00:06:33.387
(scattered laughter)

00:06:33.387 --> 00:06:34.690
"Which ones are free?"

00:06:34.690 --> 00:06:35.673
And I'll say,

00:06:36.527 --> 00:06:37.363
"All of them.

00:06:40.857 --> 00:06:42.887
"All of the bananas are free."

00:06:44.140 --> 00:06:45.150
And against her better instincts,

00:06:45.150 --> 00:06:46.350
she'll pick up a banana,

00:06:47.335 --> 00:06:48.850
and say, "Thanks very much."

00:06:48.850 --> 00:06:50.203
She'll turn to leave,

00:06:50.203 --> 00:06:51.036
and just as I'm out of he peripheral,

00:06:51.036 --> 00:06:52.370
soon as I get out of her peripheral,

00:06:52.370 --> 00:06:56.013
I'll go, "Hold on a second.
Where are you going?

00:06:57.163 --> 00:06:59.825
(laughter)

00:06:59.825 --> 00:07:00.907
"I said all the bananas are free,

00:07:00.907 --> 00:07:05.134
"I didn't say all the bananas
are free to everybody."

00:07:05.134 --> 00:07:07.384
(laughter)

00:07:08.625 --> 00:07:09.856
And she'll be all angry. She'll go,

00:07:09.856 --> 00:07:10.689
"Who are they free to, then?"

00:07:10.689 --> 00:07:11.522
And then, here's the kicker,

00:07:11.522 --> 00:07:12.355
I'll go, "Me."

00:07:12.355 --> 00:07:13.616
And then I'll eat all the bananas.

00:07:13.616 --> 00:07:14.449
(laughter)

00:07:14.449 --> 00:07:15.630
Just doing laps of the banana shop,

00:07:15.630 --> 00:07:16.840
just hoofing them into my mouth,

00:07:16.840 --> 00:07:18.470
making all disturbing noises as well,

00:07:18.470 --> 00:07:19.370
I haven't worked on them yet,

00:07:19.370 --> 00:07:20.203
but I'm going to work on it

00:07:20.203 --> 00:07:21.830
and get some disturbing noises going,

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:22.663
And then she'll be all flustered,

00:07:22.663 --> 00:07:24.620
she'll be like, "Who are
you? Why are you doing this?"

00:07:24.620 --> 00:07:25.540
I've taken off my disguise.

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:26.787
I was wearing a disguise all along.

00:07:26.787 --> 00:07:27.620
(laughter)

00:07:27.620 --> 00:07:30.185
And I'll go, "It's me.
Boom! Who's too good for...

00:07:30.185 --> 00:07:31.018
(watch beeps)

00:07:31.018 --> 00:07:32.427
"Who's to good for a free banana now?

00:07:32.427 --> 00:07:33.567
"Who's to good for a free banana now?

00:07:33.567 --> 00:07:34.891
"I'm too good for a free banana.

00:07:34.891 --> 00:07:35.724
(crowd applause)

00:07:35.724 --> 00:07:36.884
"I am too good for a free banana.

00:07:36.884 --> 00:07:39.483
"Always have been, always will.

00:07:39.483 --> 00:07:42.383
"Always will, too good for a free banana."

00:07:42.383 --> 00:07:44.440
Yes. Cold like a wanker.

00:07:44.440 --> 00:07:45.850
Boom, dealt with.

00:07:45.850 --> 00:07:47.940
Dealt with, both barrels.

00:07:47.940 --> 00:07:50.024
Both barrels, I did it.

00:07:50.024 --> 00:07:53.191
(scattered laughter)

